### Finding commits and files.

## Why a search for files was refused or stopped.

# Which input was refused.
find-what-file-search = file search
# The most bytes the text can have.
find-query-too-long = the text is longer than { $max } bytes
find-query-control = the text holds control characters
find-revision-not-commit = the revision has to name a commit
# The search was stopped by whoever started it.
find-cancelled = cancelled

## The steps of a search; each is followed by what failed.

find-loading-commit = loading a commit
find-loading-tree = loading a tree
